{
  "uid": "dcms-audit-health",
  "title": "Audit log health",
  "description": "The six audit meters, chain integrity by month, and the off-box anchor lines.",
  "tags": [
    "dcms",
    "audit",
    "security"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The six meters from `docs/runbook.md`, with the alert conditions it already specified.**\n\nRead the first panel differently from the rest. `dcms.audit.recorded` **flat-lining is the alarm**, not a spike — a silent audit log and an idle platform produce identical output, so the absence of signal is the signal. That property is also why these metrics went a whole release without exporting at all: the meter was never subscribed with `AddMeter`, the SDK dropped every instrument without an error, and the symptom was indistinguishable from a quiet week. `DcmsMeterRegistrationTests` now fails the build if that recurs.\n\n`dcms.audit.chain_broken` has no threshold on purpose. Any non-zero value is an incident: a chain that fails verification is indistinguishable from one that was tampered with."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Records / sec",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dcms-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "dcms-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(dcms_audit_recorded_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "rate"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Red when zero. Flat-lining during known traffic raises AuditLogSilentDuringTraffic.",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.0001
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
